===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial}} [[systematically]]
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1898|author=w:H.G. Wells|title=w:The War of the Worlds|publisher=William Heinemann|location=London|page=|passage="So soon as they've settled all our guns and ships, and smashed our railways, and done all the things they are doing over there, they will begin catching us '''systematic''', picking the best and storing us in cages and things."}}
